	(text "Swagelok S Model - 3 wires 0 to 5V\nRload = 10k || (100k + 191k) = 9.68k\nPressure_An = 5±5% x 100k / (100k + 191k) <= 3.3V\n0V <= Pressure_An <= 3.2818V\n4073 ADC steps\nFcutoff = 1/2piRC = 1 / (2 * pi * (100k || 191k * 100n)) = 24.2 Hz\n*Manual calibration for zero (R potentiometer)\n*Manual calibration for span(range 0-5V) (S potentiometer)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.478 78.994 0)
		(effects
